# tsc -b artifacts. tsconfig.tsbuildinfo is regenerated on every
# typecheck, so tracking it only ever produced diff noise. The other two
# are belt-and-braces: tsconfig.node.json now emits its .d.ts into
# node_modules/.tmp, but a committed compiled vite.config.js silently
# shadowed vite.config.ts for the entire life of this project (Vite
# resolves the .js first), and that must not happen twice.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
vite.config.d.ts
vite.config.js
